A shallow hub, per `patterns/region/Safe.md`. Thrapstad is the open ground at the top of
the rise as much as it is the weigh-house, and every other location in Torsgaard opens onto
it directly - nothing here is gated behind anything else, and a party may go to any of the
ten on arrival in any order. The tenth, Ondtstad, is the one location outside the
settlement proper, down at the foot of the rise. The single outward edge is the causeway
running west onto B.1 Doraiath.
